Description: CZD Purple SDDM login theme (Qt6 QML)
 The SDDM 0.21 Qt6 QML login theme for the CZD Purple respin. The form lands
 in the 720x460 reserve cut into the lock wallpaper; no avatar, no user list,
 no blur.
